  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Transparency International Georgia 2022-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till Transparency International Georgia 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to TI Georgia aims to reduce opportunities for corruption by promoting transparency, accountability, and integrity in public institutions.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till TI Georgia syftar till att minska m&#xf6;jligheterna till korruption genom att fr&#xe4;mja &#xf6;ppenhet, ansvarsskyldighet och integritet i offentliga institutioner.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the intervention is defined as &quot;to support building and empowering state institutions, develop good governance and the rule of law, ensure the transparency and direct accountability of the state institutions, support fair and democratic elections (for this aim including election observations) and protect universally recognized human rights&quot;.

For achieving overall objective the intervention plans through working towards few specific objectives:

Objective 1: Contribute to reduced opportunities for corruption (including high-level corruption) in the executive branch

Objective 2: Contribute to a more transparent, accountable and citizen-responsive local governance

Objective 3: Promote transparency, accountability, and integrity in Parliament and effectiveness of Parliament as an oversight institution and a branch of power counter-balancing the Executive

Objective 4: Promote more pluralistic political system through greater transparency and accountability in political parties and more competitive and fair elections

Objective 5: Promote independence, transparency, accountability, and integrity in the justice system

Objective 6: Promoting independence, professionalism and investigative activities of journalists to empower media as an anti-corruption watchdog

Objective 7: Raising awareness on matters of high public importance and consolidating efforts to support Georgias Euro-Atlantic integration</narrative>
  </description>
